description=v3.7.10: the second bug-hunt round. The recovery command (six-restore) unsuspends six packages at a time instead of one by one - 264 packages were minutes of waiting in the worst moment - runs under the lock so it can never fight a running transition, and says plainly what recovery means while the mode is still on. The options screen now toasts each option's name, never its internal id. Suite: 600 checks, 0 failed.
